---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects">
  <section class="py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Projects & Case Studies</h1>
    <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-12 leading-relaxed">A selection of enterprise-grade cross-platform apps, backend systems, and cloud architecture deployments.</p>
    
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 border-b border-zinc-200 pb-2">In-House Engineering Leadership</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-12 mb-16">

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Hurraayy</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Swift</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Kotlin</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Hive</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Realm</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">WebSocket</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">GCP</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">GitLab CI/CD</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Led the development of a cross-platform home-sharing marketplace app (similar to Airbnb). Designed modular UI components to reduce build times by 25%. Integrated Hive caching for complex REST APIs and WebSockets for real-time pricing, resulting in a 40% reduction in API polling and significantly boosting booking accuracy.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">VALT POS</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Java</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Kotlin</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Jetpack Compose</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Android SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Payment SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">WebSocket</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Led the development of the Retail module for the VALT POS ecosystem. Successfully migrated the legacy Java order process to Kotlin and established real-time, complex order interconnections between the POS, KIOSK, and Kitchen Display System (KDS).
        </p>
      </article>
      
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">ProHealth</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Kotlin</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">.NET Core</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">WebSocket</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">WebRTC</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">AWS</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">GitHub Actions</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          A comprehensive digital healthcare suite serving over 10,000+ users. Engineered both the cross-platform applications and the secure backend services, developing robust API endpoints for appointment scheduling, prescription management, and real-time doctor-patient video and chat consultations powered by WebRTC and WebSockets.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">ExtremePOS</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">.NET Core</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Payment SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Android SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">WebSocket</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Azure DevOps</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Cross-platform enterprise apps deployed for restaurants and e-commerce platforms. Handled Docker containerization for reliable backend delivery and achieved high scalability for a user base exceeding 50,000 users.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">PrescribeRx (EHR System)</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">.NET Core</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">MS SQL Server</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Azure DevOps</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">SAP Crystal Reports</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          A comprehensive Prescription Management and EHR (Electronic Health Records) software for medical practices. Features include patient management, digital prescriptions, and practice automation to streamline healthcare delivery.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 border-b border-zinc-200 pb-2">Independent Consulting Work</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-12">
      
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">NextFi</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Web3dart</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Metamask</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Privy</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Solidity</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">IPFS</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">GraphQL</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">ObjectBox</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          An on-chain next-generation finance app. Built with Flutter, Firebase, Metamask, Privy, IPFS, and GraphQL for decentralized data and Web3 authentication.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">RideCentric</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Hive</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Maps SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Azure DevOps</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          An enterprise chauffeur management solution. Integrated robust REST APIs and Hive local caching to manage driver schedules and routing efficiently.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Health360</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Payment SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">WebSocket</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">WebRTC</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">AWS</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">GitHub Actions</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          A cross-platform digital healthcare platform designed for digital pharmacy and tele-health. Integrated WebRTC for secure video calls, Hive for local state, and automated delivery pipelines via GitHub Actions.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">ZatiqPOS</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Hive</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Payment SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">GCP</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Bitbucket Pipelines</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          A smart cloud-based restaurant POS system. Built with Flutter, Firebase and Payment SDKs, integrated with complex REST APIs, and managed via Bitbucket CI/CD pipelines.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">YakiyaPOS</h3>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mb-4 flex-wrap">
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Flutter</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Firebase</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">Payment SDK</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">NFC</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">ObjectBox</span>
          <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-600 bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-md">GitHub Actions</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          A smart NFC-Enabled restaurant POS app utilizing native NFC features for swift payments. Built with Firebase, Payment SDKs, and ObjectBox for high-performance offline data storage.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
